    "id": "8e502a40ed4c3158120b142a4716bde49e64aa0b",
    "tree_id": "4c205db0c9603b96b5e146ab4cdbb8fa7a6c6fb0",
    "message": "[ipa-delivery:729] build(delivery): private IPA 729 = the delivered 728 with MeloNX Core 743, XeniaCore 84386936 and the finished Switch 2 work\n\nFrozen on 7e9a352a (effective digest c4380012, 7919 product files). Base: the\ndelivered and verified 728 (run 43168854436).\n- MeloNX Core 743, pin a429f212, replaces 737:\n  - play-time warm-ups detached in every title;\n  - texture-array storage counts (Hogwarts only);\n  - submit and sync diagnostics.\n  Also the Consoles-page probe: it no longer loads MeloNXCore, so Switch 2 is\n  no longer blocked after visiting Consoles.\n- XeniaCore pin 84386936, ABI 4: host roots re-applied after the config load,\n  which fixes the Xbox 360 abort after an app update. Plus launch\n  diagnostics.\n- Switch 2, finished per session 04:\n  - import capacity and clone;\n  - preparation reuse and real progress, with the S2ArmPrepare progress patch;\n  - engine-pin 6afbd2c9: prepare entry only, the engine is unchanged;\n  - up-front refusals;\n  - Switch 1 / Switch 2 separation.\n- RPCS3 Core 934 kept.\n- Retained: Dolphin (inherited verify_ipa.py), ARMSX2, libretro, MeloNX\n  dependencies.\nNothing of this build has been run on an iPhone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012mUAShv9k6pSCnpW7oAF63",
    "timestamp": "2026-11-12T09:51:50Z",
